config MPIPE_IPC
	bool "Direct inter-core IPC protocol"
	select CRC
	help
	  Version 1 wire protocol for the direct M7 to HiFi4 link: framing,
	  CRC32C integrity, structural validation, and the paired session
	  state machine. Transport independent; it marshals bytes and decides
	  whether they are currently meaningful, while the IPC Service backend
	  moves them between cores.
